        "- Interaction-aware neural baselines implemented with local project modules.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Inputs and outputs\n",
        "\n",
        "- Input dataset: canonical AptaBench table loaded from the local `dataset` directory.\n",
        "- Output artifacts: saved under `results/reviewer_experiments/`.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Reproducibility notes\n",
        "\n",
        "- The notebook reuses existing modules from `src` and does not require external project code.\n",
